    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Aga Khan University Hospital, Karachi's Nutrition and Food Services Department has been ISO 22000:2005 Food Safety Practices/Hazard Analysis and Critical Control Point Analysis Management System (HACCP) certified, making it the first hospital-based food production and service programme in Pakistan to have been certified for specialised food safety standards. The Hospital has also been recertified under the new ISO 9001:2008 standards.",
